{"id":"u-f4eb2a06-3e53-41b8-937b-4a25dbff2554","src":"community","title":"3 Day Bullmastiff Weeks 1-12","author":"Marc I.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/7uZhwP-3-day-bullmastiff","desc":"Strength and Size, no heavy Overhead Press. \n\nTo determine your weight jumps each week for the main lift, add 1% of your 1 rep max for every extra rep you did on last week's AMRAP. For example, If you are working through sets of 6 and performed 10 on the AMRAP, that is 4 extra reps so your weight jump would be 4% of your 1 rep max. If I’m operating off of a 1 rep max of 400lbs, that’s 16lbs (we can safely round down to 15) added to last week's working weight. You'll need to calculate this manually, but it's not hard. This is called autoregulation.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":24,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-05-11T08:38:31.239Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":6,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Rear Delt Fly (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Front Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Spoto Press","set